+        "**The rule (Alan-ruled).** LETHAL or CONTESTED non-combat checks resolve on a SEEDED die via  — un-thumbable, hash-chained on the game-roll chain, made BEFORE the outcome is narrated; the first result stands unless the fiction itself changed.",
